      "comment": "POKER NISMO (2) finished in the money fresh when third (22.50) at this track in a Grade 5. Will strip fitter for the run. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Deserves serious consideration. BOMBAY (1) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner (30.08) three back at Wentworth Park. Well placed here and can atone this time. NOT CLIFFORD (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 22.55 beating JONESY REVENGE. Significant danger. PRINCE VINNIE (8) has strong claims after leading and holding on for a top-three finish last time out.",
